  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.5.0\n- Added .NET 10 support. The package targets .NET Standard 2.0, .NET Core 3.1, .NET 5, 6, 7, 8 and 10.\n- .NET Standard 2.0 (used by .NET Framework apps): the Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc dependency moves from 2.2.0 to 2.3.13, which brings patched versions of Newtonsoft.Json, System.Text.Encodings.Web and System.Security.Cryptography.Xml. ASP.NET Core 2.3 is the version Microsoft supports on .NET Framework; it is based on 2.1, so apps that use ASP.NET Core 2.2 packages will be moved up to 2.3.13 and any 2.2-only APIs are not available.\n- Linux and macOS: Rotativa looks for wkhtmltopdf and wkhtmltoimage without the .exe extension. Use the native builds for your platform from https://wkhtmltopdf.org/downloads.html.\n- No changes to the public API.",
